   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Black Molly**: back after 51 archived shows (1822 days) [2]\n- **Twin Human Highway**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Short Song about the 10 Freeway**: back after 132 archived shows (3532 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Isaiah**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Song for Black Sabbath's Second North American Tour**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Absolute Lithops Effect**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2014-06-10** (recommended): audience recording; 22 songs; 94 min [1]. Said about its sound: Audio was captured at a low 11.025 kHz sample rate, which the uploader admits was a mistake [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2014-06-10**: taped by tungol; transferred by roffels; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded on an iPhone 5s using the iTalk Recorder (Lite) app, version 4.6.7; Phone was kept in a zipped bag pocket while the taper stood in the middle of the crowd [1]",
